ApacheMinaSSHD.NET is created by SERALYNX LLC to help engineering firms,
developers, and contractors add secure file transfer features to their products.
The project follows the same Apache MINA SSHD server integration paradigm used
by Porta SFTP Server, while exposing a .NET-facing wrapper API.

This product includes IKVM-generated .NET assemblies derived from Apache MINA
SSHD.

